  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We have been given that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>",
